v(24,10,3)\">Jer 10:3</ref>, and in phrase <bdbheb>הָלַךְ אַחֲרֵי הַהֶבֶל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 2:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,2,5)\">Jer 2:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:15\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,15)\">2Kgs 17:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 13:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,11)\">Prov 13:11</ref> <bdbheb>הוֺן מֵהֶבֶל</bdbheb> wealth (gotten) <highlight>out of vanity</highlight>, (i.e. not by solid toil, opposed to <bdbheb>קֹבֵץ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>עַל יָד</bdbheb>) is minished (but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <bdbheb>מְבֹהָל</bdbheb>, see <ref ref=\"Prov 20:21\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(20,20,21)\">Prov 20:21</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Prov 31:30\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,30)\">Prov 31:30</ref> <bdbheb>שֶׁקֶר הַחֵן וְהֶבֶל הַיֹּ֑פִי</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Lam 4:17\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(25,4,17)\">Lam 4:17</ref> <bdbheb>אֶל עֶזְרָתֵנוּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הֶבֶל</bdbheb> to our <highlight>vain</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup>§ 193 n</sup></lookup>.) help; of life <ref ref=\"Job 7:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,7,16)\">Job 7:16</ref> <bdbheb>כִּי הֶבֶל יָמָֽי׃</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 78:33\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,33)\">Ps 78:33</ref> <bdbheb>וַיְכַל בַּהֶבֶל יְמֵיהֶם</bdbheb> consumed their days <highlight>as</highlight> (<bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb> <b>I:7 d</b> <highlight>vanity</highlight>, man <ref ref=\"Ps 39:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,39,6)\">Ps 39:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 39:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,39,12)\">Ps 39:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 62:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"62\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"62\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,62,10)\">Ps 62:10</ref> <bdbheb>הֶבֶל בְּנֵי אָדָם ֗֗֗ הֵמָּה מֵהֶבֶל יָחַד׃</bdbheb> they are altogether (made) <highlight>of vanity</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Ps 94:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"94\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"94\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,94,11)\">Ps 94:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 144:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"144\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"144\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,144,4)\">Ps 144:4</ref>, especially in Ecclesiastes (31 t. + <bdbheb>הֲבֵל הֲבָלִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 1:2\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(21,1,2)\">Eccl 1:2</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:8\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,8)\">Eccl 12:8</ref>) of the fruitlessness of all human enterprise and endeavour, <ref ref=\"Eccl 1:2\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(21,1,2)\">Eccl 1:2</ref> <bdbheb>הַכֹּל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הֶבֶל</bdbheb>, v<ref ref=\"Eccl 1:14\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(21,1,14)\">Eccl 1:14</ref> <bdbheb>הַכֹּל הֶבֶל וּרְעוּת רוּחַ</bdbheb> all was <highlight>vanity</highlight> and the pursuit of wind, <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:1\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,1)\">Eccl 2:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:14\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,14)\">Eccl 2:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:15\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,15)\">Eccl 2:15</ref> etc., <ref ref=\"Eccl 6:4\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(21,6,4)\">Eccl 6:4</