\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,35,16)\">Job 35:16</ref>, with <bdbheb>נִחַם</bdbheb> to comfort <ref ref=\"Job 21:34\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(18,21,34)\">Job 21:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 10:2\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(38,10,2)\">Zech 10:2</ref>. <highlight>Plural</highlight> <bdbheb>הֲבָלִים</bdbheb> of false gods, <ref ref=\"Deut 32:21\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,21)\">Deut 32:21</ref> <bdbheb>) כִּעֲסוּנִי בְהַבְלֵיהֶם</bdbheb> || <bdbheb>בְּלֹאאֵֿל</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:13\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,13)\">1Kgs 16:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:26\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,26)\">1Kgs 16:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 8:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,19)\">Jer 8:19</ref> <bdbheb>הַבְלֵי נֵכָר</bdbheb> || <bdbheb>(בִּפְסִילֵיהֶםׅ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Jer 10:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,8)\">Jer 10:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 14:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,14,22)\">Jer 14:22</ref> <bdbheb>הַבְלֵי הַגּוֺיִם</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 31:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,7)\">Ps 31:7</ref> <bdbheb>הַשֹּׁמְרִים הַבְלֵישָֿׁוְא</bdbheb> empty <highlight>vanities</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jonah 2:9\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(32,2,9)\">Jonah 2:9</ref> in more general sense <ref ref=\"Eccl 1:2\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(21,1,2)\">Eccl 1:2</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:8\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,8)\">Eccl 12:8</ref> <bdb